# Theme System Rules

**Status**: Updated for Phase 1 (January 2025)
**Reference**: `docs/AESTHETIC_IMPROVEMENTS_IMPLEMENTATION.md`

## Token Usage

1. **Design Tokens (MANDATORY)**
   - All design values must come from theme tokens
   - **NO hardcoded colors, spacing, or shadows**
   - Use `src/styles/theme` as single source of truth
   - See: `docs/COLOR_PALETTE_OPTIONS.md` for palette strategy

2. **Component Styles**
   - Component-specific styles in `src/styles/components`
   - Use Tailwind classes with theme tokens
   - Follow component style naming convention
   - Include dark mode support

3. **Global Styles**
   - Only global styles in `global.css`
   - No component-specific styles in global files
   - Use `@layer` directives appropriately

## Service Design Leader Color Palette

**ACTIVE PALETTE** (Implemented January 2025)

### Color Strategy

- **Primary (Deep Navy #0F2851)**: 60% - Authority & Strategy
- **Secondary (Warm Rust #D97706)**: 30% - Approachability & Australian Identity
- **Accent (Sage Green #059669)**: 10% - Growth & Service

### Theme Token Structure

```typescript
// src/styles/theme/colors.ts
export const colors = {
  // Service Design Leader Palette
  primary: {
    main: '#0F2851', // Deep Navy - trust, authority
    light: '#1a3a6e', // Lighter navy
    dark: '#0a1d3a', // Darker navy
    contrast: '#FFFFFF', // White text
  },
  secondary: {
    main: '#D97706', // Warm Rust - approachable, Australian
    light: '#F59E0B', // Lighter rust
    dark: '#B45309', // Darker rust
    contrast: '#FFFFFF',
  },
  accent: {
    main: '#059669', // Sage Green - growth, service
    light: '#10B981', // Lighter sage
    dark: '#047857', // Darker sage
    contrast: '#FFFFFF',
  },
} as const;
```

**Full palette**: See `src/styles/theme/colors.ts`

### Component Style Structure

```css
/* src/styles/components/button.css */
@layer components {
  .btn-base {
    @apply inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4;
  }
}
```

### Component Implementation

```typescript
// src/components/ui/Button.astro
import '@/styles/components/button.css';

const variantStyles = {
  primary: 'button--primary', // Uses var(--color-primary-main)
  secondary: 'button--secondary', // Uses var(--color-secondary-main)
  accent: 'button--accent', // Uses var(--color-accent-main)
};
```

```css
/* src/styles/components/button.css */
.button--primary {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-main);
  color: var(--color-primary-contrast);
}

.button--primary:hover {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-dark);
}

/* Dark mode automatically handled via token changes */
```

## Animation System

**MANDATORY**: Use unified animation system (January 2025)

### Available Files

- **TypeScript**: `src/styles/theme/animations.ts`
- **CSS Utilities**: `src/styles/animations.css`
- **Documentation**: `docs/AESTHETIC_IMPROVEMENTS_IMPLEMENTATION.md#4-unified-animation-system`

### Usage

```html
<!-- Utility classes -->
<div class="animate-fade-in-up">Content</div>

<!-- With delay -->
<div class="animate-fade-in-up delay-200">Content</div>

<!-- Scroll-triggered -->
<div data-fade>Fades when scrolled into view</div>
```

**Rule**: Never create duplicate keyframes. Use existing animations.

## Checklist

Before committing changes:

- [ ] Using theme tokens for all design values (no `#` colors)
- [ ] Component styles in `src/styles/components/`
- [ ] No hardcoded values anywhere
- [ ] Dark mode support included
- [ ] Animation uses unified system
- [ ] No inline `style` attributes
- [ ] TypeScript types updated
- [ ] Documentation updated

## Examples

### ✅ Correct Usage

```css
/* Using theme tokens */
background: var(--color-primary-main);
color: var(--color-text-primary);
border: 1px solid var(--color-border-primary);

/* Using unified animations */
.my-element {
  animation: fadeInUp 600ms cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1) forwards;
}
```

### ❌ Incorrect Usage

```css
/* FORBIDDEN - Hardcoded colors */
background: #0f2851;
color: #ffffff;
border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;

/* FORBIDDEN - Duplicate animations */
@keyframes fadeInUp {
  /* ... */
}

/* FORBIDDEN - Inline styles */
```

```astro
<!-- FORBIDDEN -->
<div style="color: var(--color-text-primary);"></div>
```

## Migration Notes

1. **When updating existing components**:
   - Move styles to component CSS file
   - Replace ALL hardcoded values with tokens
   - Add dark mode support (`:root[data-theme="dark"]`)
   - Remove any inline styles
   - Use unified animation system
   - Update documentation

2. **When creating new components**:
   - Use theme tokens from start
   - Create component CSS file in `src/styles/components/`
   - Import component CSS in component file
   - Add to component index
   - Include dark mode styles
   - Use animation utilities
   - Write documentation

